sion/load/invoke, transcript plus segments output, separate warm offline reuse, release and bounded malformed/missing-input behavior all succeed with typed results; a missing stage, undocumented workaround or unbounded wait fails."},{"id":"LA-06-ASR-SEMANTICS","rubric":"PASS only if the WAV identity and RIFF structure match, the normalized English transcript is exactly zero, segments are structured with finite nonnegative monotonic millisecond timestamps bounded by the 644 ms fixture, and output media types, sizes and SHA-256 values are recorded; exit zero or nonempty output alone fails."},{"id":"LA-09-WINDOWS-ASR","rubric":"PASS only if the exact Windows amd64 build uses the real pinned ASR model and LocalAI Whisper backend, directly records provisioning, startup/readiness, cold and warm invocation and release, and leaves no owned process, listener, lease, partial or staging artifact; controlled fixtures cannot substitute."},{"id":"LA-10-ASR-ENGINEERING","rubric":"PASS only if exact platform/build/distribution/fixture identities, isolated roots, timeouts, process lifetime, permitted network origins, observed download and disk high-water, real-call count and USD 0 spend are recorded and remain within the declared budget."},{"id":"LA-14-ASR-ENGINEERING","rubric":"PASS only with a fresh independent engineering verdict covering provenance, installation, failure behavior, lifecycle, cache ownership, semantic ASR output and cleanup on this immutable distribution; FAIL, INCONCLUSIVE or missing evidence blocks."},{"id":"LA-15-ASR-ENGINEERING","rubric":"PASS only if absence before install, the public PowerShell install route, installed hash/build identity, cold first use without prewarmed assets, separate warm offline reuse, meaningful transcript/segments, release and complete documented product-owned cleanup are directly witnessed without hidden setup or filesystem repair."}],"reportPath":"C:/Users/andre/work/portos/infinite-you/docs/temp/projects/localai/validation/cycle-