nd grammar or cleanup rubric."},"dependencies":["immutable failure witness cycle-080 customer report and retained cold/warm artifact evidence","qualified source commit 059474b2c00915865306a33ca5e3d02b618bb6f0 and tree ae5d9c87fbc99a898ad2c11e1409105d78e4a094","current reviewed origin/main containing the qualified product source and merged candidate delivery; planner records the exact clean base before task admission","existing Models cache asset service, runtime-scope ownership and typed MODEL_CACHE_NOT_FOUND/MODEL_CACHE_IN_USE/MODEL_CACHE_UNSAFE contracts"],"dependencyFidelity":"Use controlled protocol/backend fixtures and an actual compiled CLI process through the public local command boundary. Seed or invoke a deterministic task-owned managed cache only through supported Models behavior; make no real model/backend download or inference call in this implementation lane. The next fresh immutable-build TTS validation owns real-edge proof.","engineeringDecision":{"currentNativeShape":"type CompositionOpenCatalogScope interface { CompositionOpenCatalogScope(context.Context) (InvokeRuntimeScope, error) }

